  "description": "Oliver, a hairdresser obsessed by shiny things, has undertaken a journey to rescue a princess who possesses hair made of gold. It is said that the princess is far away in a tower that is surrounded by monsters. The journey proves to be challenging for Oliver who has only wielded a pair of scissors all of his life. Within the first few days, he is attacked by a beast. The beast attempts to... kiss him?! What is to happen next?!\n\n(Source: BookCube, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes a prologue.*",
